Z||000007||Tigger||02-07-2001||04:10 PM||||ALDL to laptop... sounds cheap.<P><A HREF="http://cgi.ebay.com/aw-cgi/eBayISAPI.dll?ViewItem&item=551204495" TARGET=_blank>Paperclip on the other hand</A>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>Why do you want to spend lots of money to read the ECM?  Are you planning on doing any racing, major engine mods, or is the ECM just throwing codes left and right?<P>If it's just throwing codes, ask or search the technical part of the forum.  Save the money for fixing the throwing code problems.<P>Up to you, do whatever you want.||||reg||1
